<title>JAPAN: Japan bank shares down on sector worries.</title>
<headline>Japan bank shares down on sector worries.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank shares fell sharply on Wednesday morning on the Tokyo Stock Exchange due to renewed worries about the financial health of the sector, dealers said.</p>
<p>Shares in the sector were down 2.47 percent at 0149 GMT.</p>
<p>Nippon Credit Bank Ltd and Hokkaido Takushoku Bank Ltd came under especially heavy fire, dealers said.</p>
